{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>新皇崗口岸大樓今早正式啟用，成為香港首個採用「合作查驗、一次放行」通關模式的口岸。皇崗口岸聯檢大樓共有134條自助通道及68個人工櫃位。不少旅客都指過關流程暢順。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1200301-%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%87%E5%B4%97%E5%8F%A3%E5%B2%B8%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%93%E4%BB%8A%E6%97%A9%E6%AD%A3%E5%BC%8F%E5%95%9F%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8D%E5%B0%91%E6%97%85%E5%AE%A2%E6%8C%87%E9%81%8E%E9%97%9C%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%E6%9A%A2%E9%A0%86\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>新皇崗口岸大樓今早正式啟用　不少旅客指過關流程暢順</strong></a></p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1200340-%E8%87%B3%E5%B0%9150%E5%80%8B%E6%97%85%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%98%E7%B6%93%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%87%E5%B4%97%E5%8F%A3%E5%B2%B8%E5%87%BA%E5%85%A5%E5%A2%83%E6%9C%89%E6%97%85%E8%A1%8C%E5%9C%98%E6%94%B9%E4%B9%98%E7%9B%B4%E9%80%9A%E5%B7%B4%E5%8C%97%E4%B8%8A\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>至少50個旅行團經新皇崗口岸出入境　有旅行團改乘直通巴北上</strong></a></p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1200313-%E5%A4%9A%E6%A2%9D%E5%B0%88%E7%87%9F%E5%B7%B4%E5%A3%AB%E5%B0%8F%E5%B7%B4%E7%B7%9A%E7%9B%B4%E9%81%94%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%87%E5%B4%97%E5%8F%A3%E5%B2%B8%E4%B8%8D%E5%B0%91%E5%B8%82%E6%B0%91%E6%8C%87%E6%96%B0%E5%B7%B4%E5%A3%AB%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B9%E4%BE%BF%E9%81%8E%E9%97%9C\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>多條專營巴士、小巴線直達新皇崗口岸　不少市民指新巴士路線更方便過關</strong></a></p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1200342-%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%87%E5%B4%97%E5%8F%A3%E5%B2%B8%E9%96%8B%E9%80%9A%E9%BA%A5%E7%8E%B2%E7%8E%B2%E6%88%90%E9%A6%96%E4%BD%8D%E5%85%A5%E5%A2%83%E8%BB%8A%E4%B8%BB%E7%A8%B1%E5%BE%88%E6%A6%AE%E5%B9%B8%E9%AB%94%E9%A9%97%E6%AD%B7%E5%8F%B2%E6%80%A7%E6%99%82%E5%88%BB%E7%B6%B2%E7%B5%A1%E7%86%B1%E8%A9%B1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>新皇崗口岸開通｜麥玲玲成首位入境車主　稱很榮幸體驗歷史性時刻｜網絡熱話</strong></a></p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1200314-%E7%9A%87%E5%B7%B4%E7%9B%B8%E4%BC%B4%E4%B8%89%E5%8D%81%E8%BC%89%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90%E6%AD%B7%E5%8F%B2%E4%BB%BB%E5%8B%99%E4%B8%8D%E5%B0%91%E5%B8%82%E6%B0%91%E5%8F%8A%E5%B7%B4%E5%A3%AB%E8%BF%B7%E9%81%93%E5%88%A5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>「皇巴」相伴三十載完成歷史任務　不少市民及巴士迷道別</strong></a></p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1200288-%E7%8F%BE%E5%A0%B4%E6%9C%AC%E5%8F%B0%E8%A8%98%E8%80%85%E7%94%B1%E8%91%B5%E8%8A%B3%E7%AB%99%E4%B9%98%E5%B7%B4%E5%A3%AB%E5%88%B0%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%87%E5%B4%97%E5%8F%A3%E5%B2%B8%E8%A1%8C%E8%BB%8A%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%88%87%E4%B9%9D%E5%B7%B4%E9%A0%90%E8%A8%88%E4%B8%80%E8%87%B4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>現場｜本台記者由葵芳站乘巴士到新皇崗口岸　行車時間與九巴預計一致</strong></a></p><p></p><p>一名九旬老婦昨日在德朗邨被外傭襲擊，昏迷送院搶救後不治。警方以「謀殺」拘捕50多歲外傭。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1200355-%E5%BE%B7%E6%9C%97%E9%82%A8%E8%AC%80%E6%AE%BA%E6%A1%88%E8%AD%A6%E6%96%B9%E6%8C%87%E5%A4%96%E5%82%AD%E6%9B%BE%E5%9C%A8%E7%B4%847%E5%88%86%E9%90%98%E5%85%A7%E6%8E%A5%E9%80%A3%E8%A5%B2%E6%93%8A%E4%B9%9D%E6%97%AC%E4%BA%8B%E4%B8%BB%E6%B6%89%E8%AC%80%E6%AE%BA%E8%A2%AB%E6%8D%95\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>德朗邨謀殺案｜警方指外傭曾在約7分鐘內接連襲擊九旬事主　涉謀殺被捕</strong></a></p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1200335-%E4%B9%9D%E6%97%AC%E8%80%81%E5%A9%A6%E6%98%A8%E6%97%A5%E8%A2%AB%E5%A4%96%E5%82%AD%E8%A5%B2%E6%93%8A%E6%98%8F%E8%BF%B7%E9%80%81%E9%99%A2%E6%90%B6%E6%95%91%E5%BE%8C%E4%B8%8D%E6%B2%BB%E8%AD%A6%E6%96%B9%E4%BB%A5%E8%AC%80%E6%AE%BA%E6%8B%98%E6%8D%95%E4%BA%94%E6%97%AC%E5%A4%96%E5%82%AD\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>九旬老婦昨日被外傭襲擊昏迷送院搶救後不治　警方以「謀殺」拘捕五旬外傭</strong></a></p><p></p><p>大埔龍尾村蔡天鳳肢解案續審。蔡天鳳的母親張燕花提及鄺球一家人都不願意出售加多利山物業，又否認鄺港智曾經給錢她償還賭債。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1200295-%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3%E7%A2%8E%E5%B1%8D%E6%A1%88%E8%94%A1%E6%AF%8D%E7%A8%B1%E9%84%BA%E5%AE%B6%E4%B8%8D%E9%A1%98%E5%94%AE%E5%8A%A0%E5%A4%9A%E5%88%A9%E5%B1%B1%E7%89%A9%E6%A5%AD%E5%90%A6%E8%AA%8D%E6%94%B6%E9%84%BA%E6%B8%AF%E6%99%BA%E9%8C%A2%E9%82%84%E8%B3%AD%E5%82%B5\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>蔡天鳳碎屍案｜蔡母稱鄺家不願售加多利山物業　否認收鄺港智錢還賭債</strong></a></p><p></p><p>新田公路發生交通意外。一輛專線小巴與貨車相撞。19人受傷。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1200276-%E6%96%B0%E7%94%B0%E5%85%AC%E8%B7%AF%E6%9C%89%E5%B0%88%E7%B7%9A%E5%B0%8F%E5%B7%B4%E8%88%87%E8%B2%A8%E8%BB%8A%E7%9B%B8%E6%92%9E19%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%97%E5%82%B7\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>新田公路有專線小巴與貨車相撞　19人受傷</strong></a></p><p></p><p>位於中環的BAR LEONE，蟬聯全球年度50最佳酒吧第一位。本港共有4間酒吧上榜。評審機構表示香港重奪亞洲「雞尾酒之都」地位。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1200296-%E4%B8%AD%E7%92%B0BARLEONE%E8%9F%AC%E8%81%AF%E5%85%A8%E7%90%83%E5%B9%B4%E5%BA%A650%E6%9C%80%E4%BD%B3%E9%85%92%E5%90%A7%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E4%BD%8D\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>中環BAR LEONE蟬聯全球年度50最佳酒吧第一位</strong></a></p><p></p><p>(旁述由AI生成)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T09:39:17.301407+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":649,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T09:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T10:37:46.343787+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T09:37:38.507083+00:00","content_hash":"915523f86192b9ae204db051299f6ec1702c8c7b5cb02c442a3fb6fde1351b0c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}